==Post Big Brother==
[[File:Chelsie TAR 38.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Jack and Chelsie's Cast Photo for ''The Amazing Race: European Adventure'']]
* Chelsie competed on on the [[w:c:amazingrace:The Amazing Race: European Adventure|thirty-eighth season]] of ''The Amazing Race'' featuring BB alumni and their loved ones alongside her father Jack. Former alumni [[Angela Murray]], [[Enzo Palumbo]], [[Hannah Chaddha]], [[Izzy Gleicher]], [[Jag Bains]], [[Joseph Abdin]], [[Kathryn Dunn]], [[Kyland Young]], [[Natalie Negrotti]], [[Rubina Bernabe]], [[Taylor Hale]], [[Tucker Des Lauriers]] and [[Matt Turner]] also competed. They were eliminated in the tenth episode, placing 5th.
* Chelsie was featured in a recurring segment on  ''[[Big Brother: Unlocked/Season 1]]'', the "Fantasy BB" houseguest draft alongside Taylor and [[Derrick Levasseur]].
* Chelsie is rumored to be competing on an untitled Netflix survival show alongside [[Natalie Eva Marie]].
* Chelsie made an an appearance during the sixth episode of ''[[Big Brother: Unlocked/Season 2]]'' that aired on September 18, 2026.
==Trivia==
*Chelsie is the first person of color to win four HOHs in a single season.
*All times Chelsie was the Head of Household, her original target was a woman.
*Chelsie was never a [[Have-Not]].
*Chelsie is the first woman to win with a [[Perfect Game]].
*Chelsie is the niece of actress [[wikipedia:Niecy Nash|Niecy Nash]].<ref>https://www.etonline.com/media/videos/niecy-nash-betts-reacts-to-niece-chelsies-big-brother-win-and-potential-family-reality</ref>
*Chelsie is the first winner of [[Big Brother U.S. (franchise)|''Big Brother US'']] to win the second Head of Household Competition.
